msgid ""
"Everything else is a one-node claim: one DAPI node, or one service such as "
"Platform Explorer, Radar’s crawler, Hyphen or Insight, said so, and nothing "
"in your browser could check it. Radar names the source beside each figure, "
"with its age. Core data is read from DAPI nodes and is not proof-checked."
